files, one for each laser making the data input somewhat more
complicated than for Spot or Genepix. =20
=20
Thanks
=20
Barry
=20
Barry S. Henderson, Ph.D.
Senior Scientist
Ribonomics, Inc.
barry.henderson@ribonomics.com
