  -----Original Message-----
  From: bioconductor-admin@stat.math.ethz.ch
[mailto:bioconductor-admin@stat.math.ethz.ch]On Behalf Of Barry Henderson
  Sent: Monday, 24 June 2002 11:54 PM
  To: bioconductor@stat.math.ethz.ch
  Subject: [BioC] Anyone Working with Imagene Data Files


  Hi



  Is anyone working with Imagene data files?  Imagene creates 2 data files,
one for each laser making the data input somewhat more complicated than for
Spot or Genepix.



  Thanks



  Barry



        Barry S. Henderson, Ph.D.
        Senior Scientist
        Ribonomics, Inc.
        barry.henderson@ribonomics.com











